{#
    Tiny partial so command-net-theme can show this plugin's live online count without
    calling command_net_online_count() directly from its own Twig source. A direct call
    would fail Twig's compile-time function lookup whenever this plugin isn't installed
    at all (no bundle, no Twig extension) - `{% if %}` guards only skip execution, they
    don't skip Twig validating that the function exists while parsing the template. This
    partial lives in the plugin's own namespace, so the theme can safely load it with
    `{% include '@CommandNetPlugin/frontend/online_count.html.twig' ignore missing %}`:
    if the plugin isn't installed, the include silently resolves to nothing instead of
    failing to compile.
#}
{{ command_net_online_count() }}
